Thanks again! I've applied your advice to making the mesh:
max.edge = 15
mesh <- inla.mesh.2d(boundary = ROI_sp,
                     loc = pres[, c("x", "y")],
                     max.edge = c(1, 5) * max.edge,
                     offset = c(1, 2) * max.edge,
                     cutoff = 5,
